# Kavaron Skywarden (a 4/5 with reach): "Void - At the beginning of your end step, if a nonland permanent left the battlefield this turn or a spell was warped this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Turn 1 Black Lotus is sacrificed for mana to pay for it, so at Bot1's end step the "if" holds and it gets a +1/+1 counter: a 5/6. On turn 3 nothing leaves the battlefield, and the departure of turn 1 does not count (it is not "this turn"), so the counter stays at one at the end of that turn.

